てみてください⋆*"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "四期生LIVE"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://sakurazaka46.com/s/s46/page/4th_generation_live"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobyc8htZ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "毎日朝から晩までリハーサル頑張ってます^_^‪"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "1週間切ってます！\n猫さんも応援してくれてます📣"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先程、グッズも解禁されました~\nたくさん身につけて、参戦してみてください^_^‪"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "四期生LIVE、一生忘れられないものにします。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひ観てください~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして、15th Singleオンラインミーグリの第4次受付が明日5月28日14時までです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まだまだお話できる時間たくさんあります~\n四期生LIVEのことかツアーのこととか\nたくさんお話しましょ！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "待ってます~( ¨̮ )"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後までブログを読んでくださりありがとうございます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またきてね！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "山田桃実"}], "source": "official"}